#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/001_the_old_boat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Salt! Now I can keep the butter and the fish. You rowed well. The boat is yours now."
msgstr ""
"Salt! Nu kan jeg holde smørret og fisken friske. {crew|Du|Du|I} roede godt. Båden er "
"{crew|din|din|jeres} nu."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/001_the_old_boat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Vikings kept food with salt, smoke and drying: there was no ice in summer."
msgstr "Vikingerne holdt maden frisk med salt, røg og tørring: der var ingen is om sommeren."

