#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/002_a_pet_of_my_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our cat had five kittens, and Mother says we can keep only one. Would you take the little grey "
"one? It purrs like a drum! Row it home to your farm."
msgstr ""
"Vores kat fik fem killinger, og mor siger, at vi kun må beholde én. Vil {crew|du|du|I} tage den "
"lille grå? Den spinder som en tromme! Ro den hjem til {crew|din|din|jeres} gård."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/002_a_pet_of_my_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here she is. Hold her basket tight, she wants to see the fish!"
msgstr "Her er hun. Hold godt fast i kurven, hun vil se fiskene!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/002_a_pet_of_my_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A kitten! She can sleep by the fire and catch the mice in the grain. What a good little sailor."
msgstr "En killing! Hun kan sove ved ilden og fange musene i kornet. Sikken en god lille sømand."

