msgid "The Sneezing Sheep"
msgstr "Det nysende får"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/004_the_sneezing_sheep/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our sheep sneezes and sneezes. Row to the island of Laxön and ask Tova the healer what helps."
msgstr "Vores får nyser og nyser. Ro til øen Laxön, og spørg helbrederen Tova, hvad der hjælper."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/004_the_sneezing_sheep/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A sneezing sheep? It has a cold. Thyme helps: here is a bundle. Steam it in warm water and let her"
" breathe it."
msgstr ""
"Et nysende får? Det er forkølet. Timian hjælper: her er et bundt. Kog det i varmt vand, og lad "
"fåret ånde dampen ind."

