#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your kitten is gone! She did not come for her milk this morning. Ask the boats on the lakes if "
"anyone has seen her."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Din|Din|Jeres} killing er væk! Hun kom ikke efter sin mælk i morges. Spørg bådene på søerne,"
" om nogen har set hende."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A grey kitten? I saw one jump off a boat at Kråkhamn, by the boathouse!"
msgstr "En grå killing? Jeg så en springe fra en båd i Kråkhamn, ved bådehuset!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A grey kitten? No... but cats love warm, quiet places with wood shavings."
msgstr "En grå killing? Nej... men katte elsker varme, stille steder med høvlspåner."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In my boathouse, in the wood shavings: your kitten! And four tiny kittens of her own! You can take"
" them all home in a basket."
msgstr ""
"I mit bådehus, i høvlspånerne: {crew|din|din|jeres} killing! Og fire bittesmå killinger af hendes "
"egne! {crew|Du|Du|I} kan tage dem alle med hjem i en kurv."

