#: data/missions/020_fog_on_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A fog has fallen, and my children Ivar and Märta rowed out to the islands this morning! Old "
"Halvard knows the islands best. Please find them!"
msgstr ""
"Der er faldet tåge på, og mine børn Ivar og Märta roede ud til øerne i morges! Gamle Halvard "
"kender øerne bedst. Find dem, jeg beder {crew|dig|dig|jer}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/020_fog_on_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In this fog? Listen... I heard children's voices by Bergö, the island of the potter. Row there, "
"slowly!"
msgstr ""
"I den her tåge? Hør... jeg hørte børnestemmer ved Bergö, pottemagerens ø. Ro derhen, langsomt!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/020_fog_on_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"They were sitting by my kiln to keep warm. Here, take them home, they are not hurt, only cold."
msgstr ""
"De sad ved min ovn for at holde sig varme. Her, tag dem med hjem, de er ikke kommet til skade, de "
"fryser bare."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/020_fog_on_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
