#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley in Spring"
msgstr "Byg om foråret"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fields are dry: time to sow! Plant barley, and while it grows, sell two crates of eggs to Orm "
"in Hallvik to buy more seed."
msgstr ""
"Markerne er tørre: tid til at så! Så byg, og mens den gror, kan {crew|du|du|I} sælge to kasser æg "
"til Orm i Hallvik for at købe mere sæd."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The barley is sown. Now the sun and the rain do the work."
msgstr "Byggen er sået. Nu gør solen og regnen arbejdet."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eggs! I make my famous egg cake. Here, good silver for good eggs."
msgstr "Æg! Jeg laver min berømte æggekage. Her, godt sølv for gode æg."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley was the most important grain of the north: for bread, porridge and ale."
msgstr "Byg var det vigtigste korn i Norden: til brød, grød og øl."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Great Hold"
msgstr "Det store lastrum"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now we make your boat great! Ten planks from Frosttorp, three crates of tools, and 30 silver. Then"
" she takes two more crates. Ten planks are more than you can carry at once."
msgstr ""
"Nu gør vi {crew|din|din|jeres} båd stor! Ti planker fra Frosttorp, tre kasser værktøj og 30 sølv. "
"Så kan den tage to kasser mere. Ti planker er mere, end {crew|du|du|I} kan fragte på én gang."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Planks again? Bjarne is building you a ship!"
msgstr "Planker igen? Bjarne bygger da et skib til {crew|dig|dig|jer}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Iron for the rivets. Now my wages."
msgstr "Jern til nitterne. Nu min løn."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Two more crates! And go and see Signe in Ekvik: she builds real ships, and my crates go with you "
"into any of them."
msgstr ""
"To kasser mere! Og tag hen til Signe i Ekvik: hun bygger rigtige skibe, og mine kasser følger med "
"{crew|dig|dig|jer} over i et hvilket som helst af dem."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A knarr, the cargo ship of the vikings, could carry the load of twenty boats."
msgstr "En knarr, vikingernes lastskib, kunne fragte lige så meget som tyve både."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bjørn's Salt Run"
msgstr "Bjørns salttur"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My boat leaks, and the fishers of Ekvik wait for salt! Take eight sacks for me from here to Ekvik."
" Your new hold is just right."
msgstr ""
"Min båd er utæt, og fiskerne i Ekvik venter på salt! Tag otte sække med for mig herfra til Ekvik. "
"{crew|Dit|Dit|Jeres} nye lastrum passer lige præcis."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bjørn's salt, brought by you? Then I pay you, not him. Ha!"
msgstr ""
"Bjørns salt, bragt af {crew|dig|dig|jer}? Så betaler jeg {crew|dig|dig|jer} og ikke ham. Ha!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eight sacks of the best salt from the sea. Keep them dry!"
msgstr "Otte sække af det bedste salt fra havet. Hold dem tørre!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
