#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Canoe Race"
msgstr "Kanokapløbet"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Race us! Whoever touches the jetties of Ålberga, Dimmberga and Svanetorp first and comes back here"
" wins. Can you do it before the day ends?"
msgstr ""
"Kap med os! Den, der først rører bryggerne i Ålberga, Dimmberga og Svanetorp og kommer tilbage "
"hertil, vinder. Kan {crew|du|du|I} nå det, før dagen er omme?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ålberga: touched! The canoe is right behind you!"
msgstr "Ålberga: rørt! Kanoen er lige bag {crew|dig|dig|jer}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Dimmberga! Row, row, they are close!"
msgstr "Dimmberga! Ro, ro, de er tæt på!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Svanetorp! Now back to Kråkhamn!"
msgstr "Svanetorp! Nu tilbage til Kråkhamn!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You won! But only by a nose. Next time we win! Here, the prize: a honey cake each, and silver."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Du|Du|I} vandt! Men kun med en næse. Næste gang vinder vi! Her er præmien: {crew|en "
"honningkage|en honningkage|en honningkage til hver} og sølv."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/059_the_canoe_race/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Vikings loved contests: rowing, swimming, wrestling and running."
msgstr "Vikingerne elskede konkurrencer: roning, svømning, brydning og løb."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hild's Wedding"
msgstr "Hilds bryllup"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My daughter Hild marries Leif the shepherd! I can forge a sword, but a wedding? Bring four casks "
"of mead from Dimmberga and two crates of cloth for her dress."
msgstr ""
"Min datter Hild skal giftes med hyrden Leif! Jeg kan smede et sværd, men et bryllup? Bring fire "
"fade mjød fra Dimmberga og to kasser klæde til hendes kjole."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead! Now the cloth."
msgstr "Mjød! Nu klædet."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My sweetest mead, for Hild. Tell her to be happy!"
msgstr "Min sødeste mjød, til Hild. Sig til hende, at hun skal være lykkelig!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Blue cloth for my dress! Father cries, he says it is the smoke. Come to the wedding!"
msgstr "Blåt klæde til min kjole! Far græder, han siger, det er røgen. Kom til brylluppet!"

#. who speaks in a task
