#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for Ålberga"
msgstr "Hø til Ålberga"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So many lambs this spring! The ewes eat and eat, and my hay is gone. Bring me eight crates of hay "
"within two days."
msgstr ""
"Så mange lam i år! Fårene spiser og spiser, og mit hø er sluppet op. Bring mig otte kasser hø "
"inden for to dage."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eight crates! The ewes munch, and the lambs jump around. Take a fleece of the softest wool."
msgstr "Otte kasser! Fårene gumler, og lammene hopper rundt. Tag et skind med den blødeste uld."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A sheep eats about two kilograms of hay a day."
msgstr "Et får spiser omkring to kilo hø om dagen."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ferryman's Last Trip"
msgstr "Halvards sidste tur"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard says his bones are too old for the oars. He wants to live with his daughter in Solby. "
"Will you row him there? He has stories for the whole way."
msgstr ""
"Gamle Halvard siger, at hans knogler er for gamle til årerne. Han vil bo hos sin datter i Solby. "
"Vil {crew|du|du|I} ro ham derhen? Han har historier til hele turen."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Father! Come in, your chair by the fire is ready. Thank you for bringing him."
msgstr "Far! Kom ind, din stol ved ilden er klar. Tak, fordi {crew|du|du|I} bragte ham."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard: Two young skippers for an old ferryman! Did I ever tell you about the sea serpent?"
msgstr ""
"Gamle Halvard: {crew|En ung skipper|En ung skipper|To unge skippere} til en gammel færgemand! Har "
"jeg nogensinde fortalt {crew|dig|dig|jer} om søslangen?"

