#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Chieftain's Horse"
msgstr "Høvdingens hest"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My horse Grane will not eat, and he is sad. Bring Tova to look at him, and take her home after."
msgstr ""
"Min hest Grane vil ikke spise, og han er trist. Hent Tova, så hun kan se på ham, og ro hende hjem "
"bagefter."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tova: Just as I thought: a sore tooth. I file it smooth... There. Let him rest a night."
msgstr "Tova: Lige som jeg troede: en øm tand. Jeg filer den glat... Sådan. Lad ham hvile en nat."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not eating? Let me see his teeth."
msgstr "Spiser han ikke? Lad mig se hans tænder."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Back on my island. You were good assistants: soon you heal on your own."
msgstr ""
"Tilbage på min ø. {crew|Du var en god hjælper|Du var en god hjælper|I var gode hjælpere}: snart "
"kan {crew|du|du|I} helbrede på egen hånd."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grane eats like a wolf again! Take Tova home, with my thanks."
msgstr "Grane spiser som en ulv igen! Ro Tova hjem, med min tak."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Horses' teeth grow all their life; sometimes they must be filed smooth."
msgstr "Hestes tænder vokser hele livet; nogle gange skal de files glatte."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Brooch for Thora"
msgstr "En broche til Thora"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I want a brooch like a dragon! Hrafn makes it, if he gets glass beads for the eyes from the "
"market. And it costs 15 silver: I have saved them."
msgstr ""
"Jeg vil have en broche som en drage! Hrafn laver den, hvis han får glasperler til øjnene fra "
"markedet. Og den koster 15 sølv: dem har jeg sparet sammen."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Green eyes for a dragon. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "Grønne øjne til en drage. Kom tilbage i morgen."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Green glass beads, from very far away. Small, but precious!"
msgstr "Grønne glasperler, fra meget langt væk. Små, men kostbare!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "It is beautiful! Here, Father gave me 30 silver for you, and two are extra."
msgstr "Den er smuk! Her, far gav mig 30 sølv til {crew|dig|dig|jer}, og to af dem er ekstra."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A dragon with green eyes, biting its tail. Careful, the pin is sharp!"
msgstr "En drage med grønne øjne, der bider sig selv i halen. Pas på, nålen er skarp!"

