#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ducklings"
msgstr "Ællingerne"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We found seven ducklings in Stormvik harbour, without their mother! Grim says a duck with no "
"ducklings swims sadly in his swan cove. Can you bring them to her?"
msgstr ""
"Vi fandt syv ællinger i havnen i Stormvik, uden deres mor! Grim siger, at en and uden ællinger "
"svømmer trist rundt i hans svanevig. Kan {crew|du|du|I} bringe dem til hende?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look: the duck swims to them, and they all paddle after her in a line. Seven! Ha!"
msgstr "Se: anden svømmer hen til dem, og de padler alle sammen efter hende på række. Syv! Ha!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Peep, peep! They are in a basket with some straw. Hurry!"
msgstr "Pip, pip! De er i en kurv med lidt halm. Skynd {crew|dig|dig|jer}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/068_the_ducklings/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "They found their mother? Hooray! You are the best."
msgstr "Fandt de deres mor? Hurra! {crew|Du er den bedste|Du er den bedste|I er de bedste}."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
