#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We hold a feast here on the farm, for all our friends! Invite them: hail three boats on the lakes,"
" and visit Tova and Ragnfrid."
msgstr ""
"Vi holder fest her på gården for alle vores venner! Inviter dem: hils på tre både på søerne, og "
"besøg Tova og Ragnfrid."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast? Of course! I will tell everybody on the lakes."
msgstr "En fest? Selvfølgelig! Jeg fortæller det til alle på søerne."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast at your farm? We come, and bring our fiddle!"
msgstr "En fest på {crew|din|din|jeres} gård? Vi kommer og tager vores fiol med!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Count on me! I bring my best fish."
msgstr "Regn med mig! Jeg tager min bedste fisk med."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "I would not miss it! I come with my herb wine."
msgstr "Det vil jeg ikke gå glip af! Jeg kommer med min urtevin."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We come with all the horses! Silke wants to see her daughter."
msgstr "Vi kommer med alle hestene! Silke vil gerne se sin datter."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A great feast could last a week, with guests from every farm around."
msgstr "En stor fest kunne vare en uge, med gæster fra alle gårdene omkring."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
